Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fourth gap pass (1/3): animation, mesh and 3D
 capabilities the layer tables name

vieww-animation: clock (GSAP lagSmoothing, exact FrameClock), units (px/%/em/rem/vw/vh/pt, angles, directional rotation), inertia (VelocityTracker, InertiaPlugin with snap/bounds, Physics2D), phase (SwiftUI PhaseAnimator + KeyframeAnimator with linear/cubic/spring/move keys), cinematic (Sequencer with camera cuts, blends, dolly paths, dolly zoom, shake, event markers), duplicator (Cavalry distributions + falloffs).
vieww-mesh: CSG booleans by BSP (volumes checked by inclusion-exclusion), cube primitive, glTF skins, JOINTS/WEIGHTS, morph targets and weights channels.
vieww-3d: skinning (LBS + dual-quaternion, candy-wrapper measured), morph targets, Skinned/Points/Clustered content, custom fragment shaders + node-material graphs, G-buffer Frame + post stack (SSAO, SSR, DoF, bloom, fog, ACES/Reinhard/filmic, grading, CA, vignette, grain, FXAA), meshlets with cone culling and cluster LOD, stereo rig (side-by-side, anaglyph), Viewport3D on_frame/on_pick.
film_lab: Rng re-export visibility after the merge.

