 the compositor's CV tools
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

vieww-image: codec — DEFLATE/zlib (inflate all block types; LZ77 + dynamic Huffman), PNG (all colour types, 1–16 bit, Adam7, tRNS; adaptive-filter encoder), GIF (animated LZW decode with disposal/interlace/transparency; median-cut encoder), baseline JPEG (decoder with any sampling + restarts, named refusals for progressive/arithmetic/CMYK; 4:2:0 encoder), BMP. The image crate dependency is gone from vieww-image.
vieww-video: off the image crate too; avi (Motion-JPEG AVI reader as a VideoSource + writer with idx1), cv (Shi–Tomasi features, pyramidal Lucas–Kanade, multi-scale Horn–Schunck, blobs), solve (DLT homography, RANSAC, Zhang planar camera solve, corner pin), roto (GrabCut: GMMs + Dinic min-cut; optical-flow propagation), warp (MLS rigid puppet pins), upscale (Lanczos, bicubic, RAISR learned upscaler beating Lanczos on unseen images), motion_blur (shutter accumulation, vector blur), queue (render queue with output modules).
vieww-effects: synth — a Hydra-language live video synth with positioned parse errors.

